# Crabomination: "You may cast a spell from among cards exiled this way": the casting is optional. The same position as
# crabomination-casts-the-card-exiled-from-the-graveyard, but Bot1 chooses no card: the Lightning Bolt stays in exile with
# the two Islands, Bot2 takes no damage and its graveyard is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Swamp
Crabomination
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Island x12

[Actions]
